cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Image Compression Benchmark: Classical Codecs vs. Steered Mixture of Experts"
abstract: >-
  A rate-distortion benchmark of JPEG, JPEG 2000 and AVIF against the Steered
  Mixture of Experts (SMoE) model on five 8-bit grayscale images. All operating
  points are placed on a common bits-per-pixel axis; SMoE rate is measured from
  the fitted model parameters rather than from the decoded image.
